13
00:00:46,223 --> 00:00:47,423
Life between entry points,

14
00:00:47,463 --> 00:00:50,324
Where rush and noise dissolve.

15
00:00:50,344 --> 00:00:55,384
Where you breathe, where you live unforced,

16
00:00:55,504 --> 00:00:59,424
And hear your soul resolve.

17
00:00:59,464 --> 00:01:09,325
And hear your soul resolve.

18
00:01:09,385 --> 00:01:13,385
