19
00:01:13,505 --> 00:01:26,546
No orders there, just springtime flows.

20
00:01:26,566 --> 00:01:28,426
My son walks up, hugs me tight - light,

21
00:01:28,446 --> 00:01:30,786
That’s my strongest setup tonight.

22
00:01:30,806 --> 00:01:33,027
Not the chart matters, but who’s near,

23
