Warm breakfast, a simple “we’re here.”

24
00:01:35,127 --> 00:01:36,767
No trader, no hero, no role to defend,

25
00:01:36,787 --> 00:01:39,347
Just a living man - that’s the trend.

26
00:01:39,427 --> 00:01:40,507
Life between entry points,

27
00:01:40,527 --> 00:01:42,587
Where the soul feels like nature’s voice.

28
00:01:42,627 --> 00:01:44,607
Where the heart beats steady with fate,

29
00:01:44,627 --> 00:01:50,828
And you don’t rush headfirst into choice.

30
00:01:50,868 --> 00:01:56,648
And you don’t rush headfirst into choice.

31
00:01:56,688 --> 00:02:01,589
I’m not a hunter, I turned into a light,

32
00:02:01,609 --> 00:02:23,550
Watching the tide, breathing deep, feeling right.

33
00:02:23,570 --> 00:02:26,110
I don’t bend to the rate, don’t tear for the peak,

34
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:28,230
I live between entries - calm and complete.

35
00:02:28,250 --> 00:02:30,351
Storms moved on, but my roots went deep,

36
00:02:30,371 --> 00:02:32,791
The world past the screen is the path I keep.

37
00:02:32,811 --> 00:02:35,351
Where silence lives - that’s home to me,

38
00:02:35,451 --> 00:02:37,791
Every breath now loud, every breath free.

39
00:02:37,811 --> 00:02:39,651
Life between entry points,

40
00:02:39,691 --> 00:02:43,672
Where freedom’s real, not styled.

41
00:02:43,732 --> 00:02:49,572
Where simply “being” hits harder

42
00:02:49,732 --> 00:03:08,113
Than a thousand brand-new files.

43
00:03:08,333 --> 00:03:20,694
Than a thousand brand-new files.

44
00:03:20,714 --> 00:03:23,094
Not every answer lives in trades or the count,

45
00:03:23,134 --> 00:03:24,654
Sometimes peace is the highest amount.

46
00:03:24,714 --> 00:03:26,675
When I stop chasing, just stand and feel,

47
00:03:26,695 --> 00:03:28,495
I realize - this heaven is real.

48
00:03:28,515 --> 00:03:30,935
Not entry, not exit - just motion and breath,

49
00:03:30,955 --> 00:03:33,355
Life’s not a target, it’s moments, not death.

50
00:03:33,535 --> 00:03:35,735
I don’t wait for signals flashing on screens,

51
00:03:35,775 --> 00:03:37,855
I am the signal - right here in between.

52
00:03:37,935 --> 00:03:47,896
